Subject: [PATCH V7 19/24] block: loop: pass multipage bvec to iov_iter
Date:   Wed, 27 Jun 2018 20:45:43 +0800
Message-Id: <20180627124548.3456-20-ming.lei@redhat.com>
In-Reply-To: <20180627124548.3456-1-ming.lei@redhat.com>
References: <20180627124548.3456-1-ming.lei@redhat.com>
X-Scanned-By: MIMEDefang 2.78 on 10.11.54.6
X-Greylist: Sender IP whitelisted, not delayed by milter-greylist-4.5.16 (mx1.redhat.com [10.11.55.7]); Wed, 27 Jun 2018 12:49:46 +0000 (UTC)
X-Greylist: inspected by milter-greylist-4.5.16 (mx1.redhat.com [10.11.55.7]); Wed, 27 Jun 2018 12:49:46 +0000 (UTC) for IP:'10.11.54.6' DOMAIN:'int-mx06.intmail.prod.int.rdu2.redhat.com' HELO:'smtp.corp.redhat.com' FROM:'ming.lei@redhat.com' RCPT:''
